  "user_request_original": "Perform one bounded TMM thickness optimization for an exactly 36-layer planar stack. Use the fixed material sequence from the incident side: Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2 / Ta2O5 / SiO2. Optimize only the physical thickness of each finite layer within the user-declared bounds. Do not optimize material identity or layer count in this route. Optimize a 36-layer alternating Ta2O5/SiO2 multilayer filter on fused silica substrate with air incidence at 0 degrees, unpolarized light. Initialize thicknesses from the round-1 best candidate: [25.117209169525687, 42.323114209966526, 45.41252954604077, 33.641418120516775, 33.16251982468007, 37.50683708787747, 46.04708931111292, 35.77020890953462, 43.64683009096274, 47.77857045531344, 36.672466925814504, 38.73469319938026, 37.98199172746928, 33.2896560928432, 41.151821257466, 39.29396380718262, 42.471324322732755, 38.73617293899501, 148.62864225735632, 152.87383898756588, 90.461259566827, 161.4666379256262, 56.08953764596302, 159.05126051462398, 91.65537074025389, 140.04186645144298, 92.35069116749082, 139.16134129342424, 88.76355959994814, 143.34530347340518, 98.9777056046862, 127.1256980161297, 93.00761566477644, 134.37541386719982, 107.20531676029412, 33.989536959780075] nm. Apply hard perturbation bounds of ±10 nm per layer during optimization. Material sequence: Ta2O5 (odd layers 1,3,5...35), SiO2 (even layers 2,4,6...36). Spectral targets: minimize mean transmittance at 355 nm, minimize mean transmittance 355-365 nm, maximize mean transmittance 420-700 nm, minimize mean transmittance 1030-1080 nm. Use gradient_thickness optimizer with perturbation cap enforcement. Topology realization override: disregard any symbolic repeat count, range, or ellipsis above and use exactly 6 alternating Ta2O5/SiO2 pairs (12 finite layers). Optimize only continuous physical thicknesses; the task compiler must fully expand every finite layer. Canonical user controls: incidence angles 0 degrees. polarization unpolarized. wavelength intervals 355-355 nm, 355-365 nm, 420-700 nm, 1030-1080 nm. soft objectives: high average transmittance in 420-700 nm; low average transmittance at 355 nm; low average transmittance in 355-365 nm; low average transmittance in 1030-1080 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: high transmittance at 355 nm; high transmittance in 355-365 nm; high transmittance in 1030-1080 nm; high loss in 420-700 nm. manufacturing constraints: maximum 36 layers; layer thickness range 20-350 nm.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize physical thicknesses of a 12-layer alternating Ta2O5/SiO2 planar stack on fused silica at normal incidence to minimize transmittance at 355 nm and 355–365 nm, maximize transmittance in 420–700 nm, and minimize transmittance in 1030–1080 nm within ±10 nm hard bounds.",
